<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know who the CUTEST homie in the\nworld is?\fCHANSEY, obviously!\fI said CHANSEY, and that’s FINAL!\fFight me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll give you somethin’ GOOD if you\nbring me a CHANSEY! Just to look at! I\fwon’t touch!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That homie is...CHANSEY!\rWhat’s the CHANCES of seein’ CHANSEY\nthis close?! Get it? CHANCES?\rTake this as a thank-you! I’m cryin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let a CHANSEY hold this Lucky Punch,\nand it got a better chance at\fcritical hits!\rAin’t that awesome?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, you LOVELY CHANSEY! You the\nprettiest egg-carrier in the world!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know who the CUTEST homie in the\nworld is?\fCHANSEY, obviously!\fI said CHANSEY, and that’s FINAL!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eusine: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Not AGAIN! I’ma get\nthere first next time!\rFollowin’ it here, I’m startin’ to get\nwhat SUICUNE is after.\rTruth is, I’d like to keep this to\nmyself. I’m a gatekeeper.\rBut I wanna be a HONEST Hustler in\nfront of SUICUNE! It’s watchin’!\fProb’ly!\rSo here’s a clue. Looks like...\r...SUICUNE like a hilly spot near\nwater...\f...Somewhere north.\rI don’t know exactly where yet. It’s\njust you and me!\rWho find it first? It’s ON!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0351_R14_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eusine: What’s wrong, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nTruth is, I’d like to keep\fthis to myself.\rBut I wanna be a honest Hustler\nin front of SUICUNE!\rSo I’m sharin’ a clue with you.\rLooks like...\n...SUICUNE like a hilly spot\fnear water...\f...Somewhere north.\rI don’t know exactly where yet.\nIt’s just you and me!</language>
	</row>
</body>
